BOSS Mordrax Reset
    Events
        Time - BossMordrax_ResetTimer expires
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- ======== Check hostile players near ======== --------
        Set VariableSet BossMordrax_Point = (Position of BossMordrax)
        Set VariableSet BossMordrax_TargetGroup = (Units in (Region centered at BossMordrax_Point with size (1000.00, 1000.00)) matching (((Matching unit) belongs to an enemy of (Owner of BossMordrax).) Equal to True))
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Number of units in BossMordrax_TargetGroup) Greater than 0
            Then - Actions
                -------- ======== Clean up leaks ======== --------
                Custom script:   call DestroyGroup(udg_BossMordrax_TargetGroup)
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossMordrax_Point)
                -------- Start reset check timer --------
                Countdown Timer - Start BossMordrax_ResetTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 10.00 seconds
                -------- ======== cannot be started because of enemies of BOSS unit close ======== --------
                Skip remaining actions
            Else - Actions
        -------- ======== Clean up leaks ======== --------
        Custom script:   call DestroyGroup(udg_BossMordrax_TargetGroup)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossMordrax_Point)
        -------- ======== Initial check of the selected unit ======== --------
        Set VariableSet CV = (Custom value of BossMordrax)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        UnitIsCasting[CV] Equal to True
                        GCSM_UnitInCombat[CV] Equal to True
            Then - Actions
                -------- Start reset check timer --------
                Countdown Timer - Start BossMordrax_ResetTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 10.00 seconds
                -------- ======== cannot be started because of the conditions ======== --------
                Skip remaining actions
                -------- ======== ======== --------
            Else - Actions
        -------- ======== RESET======== --------
        Custom script:   call TriggerExecute(gg_trg_Mordrax_Movement_Continue)
        Unit - Add Crow Form to BossMordrax
        Animation - Change BossMordrax flying height to 600.00 at 5.00
        -------- Turn off / on relevant triggers --------
